          <rules>
            <rule id="e658-aab7-ee9d-ef59" name="Momentum" hidden="false">
              <description>Instead of suferring a normal damage roll, a small- or medium- based, non-incorporeal model hit by this attack  is slammed d3&quot; directly away from this model. The POW of the slam damage roll is equal to the POW of this weapon. The POW of collateral damage is equal to the POW of this weapon. In addition to suffering a normal damage roll, large-based models hit by this attack are knocked down.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
          <infoLinks>
