            <rule id="1165-75d6-7a6c-1dd6" name="Vortex Blast" hidden="false">
              <description>If this attack misses, nothing happens. If it directly hits an enemy model, before making the damage roll, push models within 2&quot; of the model hit 2&quot; directly toward it in the order you choose. Then center a 3&quot; AOE on the model hit. Models hit suffer a POW 12 damage roll.</description>
