        </rule>
        <rule id="3af4644e-9545-00d5-ef98-7e0c9e05126a" name="Bird&apos;s Eye" page="0" hidden="false">
          <description>While in this model&apos;s control area, models in its battlegroup extend their front arcs 360° and when determining LOS ignore cloud effects, forest terrain, and intervening models.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="35df4ea8-a0b8-c1e0-c1ed-4679ddbad822" name="Feat: Perfect Execution" page="0" hidden="false">
          <description>While in Vyros&apos; control area this turn, when a friendly Faction model destroys an enemy model with an attack, allocate 1 focus point to a warjack in Vyros&apos; battlegroup in his control area.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
