        <rule id="d480-0b05-e0f7-3903" name="Imprint: Kinetic Field" hidden="false">
          <description>During its activation, this model can spend 1 focus point to use Kinetic Field. For one turn, this model and friendly models within 3&quot; gain +2 ARM against ranged attacks and do not suffer blast damage.</description>
        </rule>
