          <description>Force Bolt is a RNG 10, POW 10 magic attack. An enemy model hit by this attack may be pushed d3&quot; directly toward or away from this model. On critical hit, the enemy model is also knocked down after being pushed.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="623981ef-dda9-84c9-78a1-f66f969dd5a8" name="Force Barrier" page="0" hidden="false">
          <description>This model gains +2 DEF against ranged attack rolls and does not suffer blast damage.</description>
        </rule>
