            <rule id="7d433645-ab9d-92c7-74bf-2e10a07bc3b5" name="Tactics: Phantom Seeker" page="0" hidden="false">
              <description>Models in this unit gain Phantom Seeker. (A model with Phantom Seeker ignores LOS when making ranged attacks. That model ignores concealment and cover when resolving ranged attacks).</description>
