          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule id="6db5-36b2-955c-1399" name="Explosivo" hidden="false">
          <description>When target friendly model makes a normal attack with a non-spray ranged weapon, the weapon gains Magical Weapon. If the weapon was AOE - it becomes AOE 3. An affected model cannot participate in a combined ranged attack. Models in the AOE other than the model that was directly hit suffer blast damage but do not suffer any other effects of the attack. Explosivo expires immediately after resolving target model&apos;s next ranged attack. Explosivo lasts for one turn.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <costs>
        <cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
      </costs>
    </selectionEntry>
