      <rules>
        <rule id="54a7-3613-8ce6-88df" name="Rampager" hidden="false">
          <description>Take control of target enemy non-character warbeast. You can make one full advance with the warbeast and can then make one normal attack with it, then Rampager expires. While the warbeast is affected by Rampager, it cannot be forced and you cannot use its animus. Rampager can be cast only once per round.</description>
